+We study decision-making under partial observation through four
+presentation-relative diagnostics: objectwise local validity, compatibility of a
+declared diagram, effective realisability, and bounded realisability. The basic
+constraint is observational uniformity: an interface cannot support different
+responses to worlds it does not distinguish. The diagnostic labels are therefore
+not invariants of bare capability predicates; they record where success first
+fails in a chosen local-to-global presentation and which incidence data are
+needed to transport that diagnosis. The static kernel is a fibrewise selector
+lemma. Classical compactness, Helly, and join-tree results provide certificate
+and gluing tools; parity, support contextuality, source integration, and Bell
+coupling give finite representations. The obstruction datum records objectwise
+local success together with the nested global spaces
+$\Gamma_{\mathrm{set}}\supseteq\Gamma_{\mathrm{eff}}\supseteq
+\Gamma_{\mathcal B}$; terminal-category compression preserves the nested global
+spaces while erasing precisely the $\mathsf D$-gap. A recursive selector game
+yields the binary DNR $\Pi^0_1$ class, with capability characterised by PA oracle
+degrees; uniform binary fibre selection and nested-prefix path selection have
+Weihrauch degree $\mathsf{WKL}$. A concrete primitive-recursive game language has
+a $\Sigma^0_3$-complete capability index set, and exact counting of finite source
+integrations is $\#\mathrm P$-complete. The causal tier fixes extensive-form
+arenas independently of strategies. Backward induction shows that
+perfect-information node-local nonemptiness implies capability; activated-valid
+partial strategies form sheaves on prefix-closed patches; active sensing
+separates full-site local failure from cover-relative matching failure.
+Distributed selectors are equivalent, for pure-strategy capability and worldwise
+loss, to blind-order one-shot arenas, while arbitrary finite pure-strategy
+imperfect-information arenas admit extensional distributed compilations. Finite
+causal-poset protocols have unique confluent executions and linear-extension
+arenas with the same operational loss. Global information recall makes pure
+action recall capability-redundant, and a countable height-two arena realises the
+same DNR class and PA-degree spectrum as the static effectivity example.
+Machine-checked artifacts cover the identified discrete and combinatorial cores.
